### ============================
### ACCOUNTS CRUD (Module 5–7)
### ============================

### 1. Create account
POST http://{{linux_vm_ip}}:8001/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": "a1",
    "owner_name": "Richa",
    "balance": 100.0
}

###

### 2. Get account
GET http://{{linux_vm_ip}}:8001/accounts/{{account_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============================
### AUTH (Module 7)
### ============================

### 3. Missing token — expect 401
GET http://{{linux_vm_ip}}:8001/accounts/a1

###

### ============================
### VERSIONING & DEPRECATION (Module 12)
### ============================

### 4. V1 — expect Deprecation + Sunset headers
GET http://{{linux_vm_ip}}:8001/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. V2 — expect account_tier field on each account
GET http://{{linux_vm_ip}}:8001/v2/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
